  and 64-bit mantissas; they are separate from today's persistent scaffold evidence.
- Today's regression uses WSL Verilator on this machine; Questa is the four-state
  compatibility smoke. The testbench golden arithmetic is unchanged.

- Persistent scaffold: ten WSL Verilator configurations passed on this machine:
